---
source: src/components/help_popup.rs
expression: "render_to_string(&mut HelpPopup::default(),\nSize::new(size.width, size.height))"
---
╭──────────────────────────── Keys ─────────────────────────────╮
│ 1 / 2 / 3       Files / Diff / Session view                   │
│ Ctrl+N          New session                                   │
│ Ctrl+O          Pick the active session                       │
│ Shift+Tab       Next session                                  │
│ Ctrl+P          Find a file                                   │
│ Ctrl+F          Search code in the repo                       │
│ /  n / N        Search this file, next / previous             │
│ Tab             Switch tree ↔ code                            │
│ j k ↑ ↓         Move down / up                                │
│ h l ← →         Tree: close / open · Code: column             │
│ Enter           Open file / toggle directory                  │
│ gg / G          Top / bottom                                  │
│ Ctrl+D / Ctrl+U Half page down / up                           │
│ 0 / $           Line start / end                              │
│ :<n>            Go to line n                                  │
│ w               Wrap long lines on / off                      │
│ Mouse           Click: cursor / open in tree · drag · wheel   │
│ v / V           Select chars / lines (again: stop)            │
│ Shift+arrows    Select lines (↑↓) or chars (←→)               │
│ c               Note the selection or line (or open its note) │
│ d               Delete the note on this line                  │
│ Enter           Show the whole note on this line              │
│ Note: Enter     Save (Shift+Enter or \ Enter: newline)        │
│ Note: Tab       Next / previous session (moves the note)      │
│ Esc             Clear the selection                           │
│ Diff: j k       Previous / next changed file                  │
│ Diff: r         Reload the diff                               │
│ Session: j k    Select note                                   │
│ Session: Enter  Jump to the note                              │
│ Session: y      Copy the compiled prompt                      │
│ Session: e / d  Edit / delete the note                        │
│ Session: J / K  Move the note down / up                       │
│ ?               This help                                     │
│ q               Quit                                          │
╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
